WEBVTT

NOTE sample

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.500
أنا سَلْمَى.
ana salma.
I am Salma.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
دِي عِيلْتِي.
di ʿēlti.
This is my family.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.000
عِنْدِي أَخ وَأُخْت.
ʿandi akh wi ukht.
I have a brother and a sister.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.000
أُمِّي بِتْحِبّ القَهْوَة.
ommi bitḥibb el-ahwa.
My mother loves coffee.
